
# Raw genealogical export: contains living people in full. Never committed to a
# Re-download from Queensland State Archives by digital representation ID.
# Scanned coronial files: 15 MB each, and images of a sensitive original. The
# public repository. Regenerate with a fresh MyHeritage GEDCOM export.
# transcriptions beside them ARE committed — that is what the archive publishes.
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
dist/
node_modules/
site/.astro/
site/public/atlas-data.json
sources/*.ged
sources/inquests/*.pdf

# A private build directory, so a check never reads a dist another session is
# halfway through writing.
site/dist-verify/
